<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Description">Description</span></h2>
<p>Sets the gender of a creature to a <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/GENDER" title="GENDER *">GENDER_*</a> constant. To be used only in <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Character%20generation" title="Character creation">character creation</a>.
</p>
